    "display_name": "Adopt-A-Pet",
    "long_instructions": "##Do This:\r\n\r\nCreate a site map for a local animal shelter web app.\r\n\r\nYour site map must include:\r\n- A home page\r\n- At least 3 main sections (for example: Pets, Adoption Info, Contact)\r\n- At least 2 levels of hierarchy (for example: Home → Pets → Dog Profile)\r\n\r\n**Save your site map to your Backpack.**",
